{"id":"wb-6-704","name":"平襄楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"姜慶樓","text":"平襄楼（又称作姜庆楼）位于四川省芦山县。1961年7月13日公布为四川省第二批历史及革命文物保护单位。1980年7月7日重新公布为四川省第一批文物保护单位。2006年5月25日公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A7%9C%E6%85%B6%E6%A8%93","revisionId":86785960,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785960","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/14bc1405cd232be01bfe2395.jpg","title":"平襄楼照片1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%B3%E8%A5%84%E6%A5%BC%E7%85%A7%E7%89%871.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/%E5%B9%B3%E8%A5%84%E6%A5%BC%E7%85%A7%E7%89%871.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Seaskky","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​Pingxiang Pavilion","width":320,"height":213}}